cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "De novo conditional protein binders for the Anthropic x Adaptyv Protein Design Competition 2026"
abstract: >-
  Design and selection of small proteins that bind a chosen human target under a
  condition: a pH window, cross-species reactivity, or receptor activation. Includes
  the measured negative results - a geometric proxy that correlated with the wrong
  sign, a depth metric that could not separate an agonist from an antagonist, and a
  cropped target that manufactured a false winner.
